sjan","html_url":"https://github.com/titusjan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-09-21T11:23:09Z","updated_at":"2016-09-21T11:23:09Z","body":"Can I inquire what the status is? This bug affects me too. I now have to disable the `no-member` warning in all modules/functions that **use** class X, not only in the module that defines it. So I would say this bug has a pretty high impact.\n\n```\n~> pylint --version\npylint 1.6.4, \nastroid 1.4.7\nPython 3.5.2 (default, Jul  6 2016, 10:28:05) \n[GCC 4.9.2]\n\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/248583012/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"titusjan","id":3320415,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzMjA0MTU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3320415?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan","html_url":"https://github.com/titusjan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/titusjan/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/249140877","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/870#issuecomment-249140877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/870","id":249140877,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI0OTE0MDg3Nw==","user":{"login":"NotSqrt","id":1997005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTcwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1997005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt","html_url":"https://github.com/NotSqrt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-09-23T09:05:49Z","updated_at":"2016-09-23T09:05:49Z","body":"I looked into it for a while:\n\nWhen hitting `@property`, astroid infers that this node is not a BoundMethod, but when hitting `foo.setter`, it says that `foo` is a `BoundMethod` now.\n\nIf the setter uses a different name, there is no collision.\n\nIn `astroid.bases._is_property`, `meth.decoratornames()` returns an empty list because, even if `meth.decorators.nodes` is not empty (`[<Attribute(setter) ...>]`), `decoratornames` catches an `InferenceError`.\n\nI hope this helps to narrow it down.\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/249140877/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"NotSqrt","id":1997005,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5OTcwMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1997005?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt","html_url":"https://github.com/NotSqrt","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NotSqrt/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/comments/249440118","html_url":"https://github.com/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/870#issuecomment-249440118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pylint-dev/pylint/issues/870","id":249440118,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI0OTQ0MDExOA==","user":{"login":"PCManticore","id":448166,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0ODE2Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/448166?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/PCManticore","html_url":"https://github.com/PCManticore","followers_u